    {
      "id": "interior-regularity-first-formal-data-and-hessian-bound",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          329,
          80,
          1060,
          955,
          1370
        ]
      ],
      "en": "We also have\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:interior-regularity-formal-laplacian-data-identity}\n\\int_\\Omega|\\Delta u|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}=\\int_\\Omega|f|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}.\n\\end{equation}\nCombining these two results gives us\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:interior-regularity-formal-hessian-boundary-estimate}\n\\int_\\Omega|\\nabla^2u|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\leq\\int_\\Omega|f|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}+|\\text{boundary terms}|.\n\\end{equation}\nThus, if we had some additional information on the boundary terms, we could derive an a priori estimate on the $H^2(\\Omega)$ norm of a solution $u$ in terms of the data $f$.",
      "zh": "还有\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:interior-regularity-formal-laplacian-data-identity}\n\\int_\\Omega|\\Delta u|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}=\\int_\\Omega|f|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}.\n\\end{equation}\n结合这两个结果得到\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:interior-regularity-formal-hessian-boundary-estimate}\n\\int_\\Omega|\\nabla^2u|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\leq\\int_\\Omega|f|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}+|\\text{boundary terms}|.\n\\end{equation}\n因此, 若有关于边界项的进一步信息, 就能用数据 $f$ 导出解 $u$ 的 $H^2(\\Omega)$ 范数的先验估计.",
      "label": null,
